		fax: 0117 925 5624


Files produced by Cadence Allegro PE24.1

Artwork:
--------

Format: Gerber RS-274X , parameters described in art_param.txt. 
All layers viewed from top

Build:
------

10-layers
ENIG finish to outer layers except for edge connector which should have a "hard gold" finish.

Layers as follows:

mib_rev3b_v232_01_Top.art
mib_rev3b_v232_02_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v232_03_sig1.art
mib_rev3b_v232_04_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v232_05_PWR1.art
mib_rev3b_v232_06_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v232_07_SIG2.art
mib_rev3b_v232_08_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v232_09_SIG3.art
mib_rev3b_v232_10_Bottom.art


Areas with selective hard gold finish:
--------------------------------------
mib_rev3b_v232_16_hardgold_top.art
mib_rev3b_v232_17_hardgold_bot.art



Solder Masks
------------

mib_rev3b_v232_13_smask_top.art
mib_rev3b_v232_14_smask_bot.art

